 VIBEAU — Mood-Based Fashion Discovery Platform

 UI/UX Case Study

VIBEAU is a mood-based fashion discovery platform designed to help users quickly discover outfits based on their mood, color preferences, and personal style.

My Role
UI/UX Designer

 Tools
- Figma
- Adobe Illustrator

 Platform
Mobile App

 Project Duration
5 Days

 Design Process

Problem Definition → User Flow → Wireframing → UI Design → Prototyping → Usability Evaluation

 Key Features

- Mood-based outfit discovery
- Color and style selection
- Outfit recommendations
- Outfit details
- 3D viewer concept
- Save outfits to favorites

 Case Study

VIBEAU explores how personalization and visual discovery can simplify the outfit-selection experience.

 Screens

The project includes onboarding, preference selection, outfit recommendations, outfit details, 3D viewer, favorites, profile, and settings screens.
